{"seq":1,"slug":"n8n-local-deployment","title":"n8n 本地部署与编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/personal-automation/workflow-orchestration/n8n-local-deployment","wordCount":987,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"n8n-本地部署与编排\">n8n 本地部署与编排</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>n8n 是 2026 年最受技术团队欢迎的开源工作流自动化平台，在 GitHub 上拥有超过 186,000 颗星。它的核心定位是&quot;开发者优先的自动化工具&quot;——既提供可视化画布进行拖拽编排，又允许在任何节点中嵌入 JavaScript/Python 代码。与 Zapier、Make 等 SaaS 平台相比，n8n 的自托管模式意味着：无执行次数限制、完整数据所有权、以及深度定制能力。</p>\n<p>本文将带你从零搭建一个生产级的 n8n 本地实例，并深入其工作流编排的核心机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"n8n-架构模型\">n8n 架构模型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐&#10;│              n8n 实例                     │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│  Web UI (Vue.js 画布编辑器)              │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│  Workflow Engine (事件循环 + 执行器)      │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│  Node 系统 (500+ 内置集成)               │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│  数据层 (SQLite/PostgreSQL)              │&#10;├─────────────────────────────────────────┤&#10;│  运行环境 (Docker/Node.js)               │&#10;└─────────────────────────────────────────┘\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│              n8n 实例                     │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  Web UI (Vue.js 画布编辑器)              │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  Workflow Engine (事件循环 + 执行器)      │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  Node 系统 (500+ 内置集成)               │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  数据层 (SQLite/PostgreSQL)              │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├─────────────────────────────────────────┤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│  运行环境 (Docker/Node.js)               │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└─────────────────────────────────────────┘</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"核心术语\">核心术语</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Workflow</td>\n<td>由节点和连接组成的自动化流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Node</td>\n<td>执行特定操作的单元（Trigger/Action/Transform）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Execution</td>\n<td>Workflow 的一次运行实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Credential</td>\n<td>存储 API 密钥等敏感信息的加密容器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Webhook</td>\n<td>接收外部 HTTP 请求的触发端点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Expression</td>\n<td>节点间数据引用的语法（<code>{{ $json.field }}</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"数据流模型\">数据流模型</h3><p>n8n 中数据以 JSON 数组的形式在节点间流动。每个节点接收上游的 <code>items[]</code>，处理后输出新的 <code>items[]</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 每个 item 的结构&#10;interface INodeExecutionData {&#10;  json: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;; // 主数据&#10;  binary?: Record&lt;string, IBinaryData&gt;; // 二进制附件&#10;  pairedItem?: { item: number }; // 上游关联&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每个 item 的结构</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> INodeExecutionData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 主数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  binary</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">IBinaryData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 二进制附件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pairedItem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">item</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 上游关联</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键数据操作模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>映射（Map）</strong>：对每个 item 变换字段</li>\n<li><strong>过滤（Filter）</strong>：根据条件保留或丢弃 item</li>\n<li><strong>聚合（Aggregate）</strong>：多个 item 合并为一个</li>\n<li><strong>拆分（Split）</strong>：一个 item 展开为多个</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"docker-compose-部署\">Docker Compose 部署</h3><p>生产级部署推荐使用 Docker Compose + PostgreSQL：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# docker-compose.yml&#10;version: &#39;3.8&#39;&#10;&#10;services:&#10;  n8n:&#10;    image: n8nio/n8n:latest&#10;    restart: always&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;5678:5678&#39;&#10;    environment:&#10;      - N8N_HOST=automation.yourdomain.com&#10;      - N8N_PORT=5678&#10;      - N8N_PROTOCOL=https&#10;      - GENERIC_TIMEZONE=Asia/Shanghai&#10;      - DB_TYPE=postgresdb&#10;      - DB_POSTGRESDB_HOST=postgres&#10;      - DB_POSTGRESDB_PORT=5432&#10;      - DB_POSTGRESDB_USER=n8n&#10;      - DB_POSTGRESDB_PASSWORD=${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}&#10;      - DB_POSTGRESDB_DATABASE=n8n&#10;      - N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY=${ENCRYPTION_KEY}&#10;      - EXECUTIONS_DATA_SAVE_ON_SUCCESS=none&#10;      - EXECUTIONS_DATA_SAVE_ON_ERROR=all&#10;      - EXECUTIONS_DATA_PRUNE=true&#10;      - EXECUTIONS_DATA_MAX_AGE=168&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - n8n_data:/home/node/.n8n&#10;    depends_on:&#10;      - postgres&#10;&#10;  postgres:&#10;    image: postgres:16&#10;    restart: always&#10;    environment:&#10;      - POSTGRES_USER=n8n&#10;      - POSTGRES_PASSWORD=${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}&#10;      - POSTGRES_DB=n8n&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data&#10;&#10;volumes:&#10;  n8n_data:&#10;  postgres_data:\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># docker-compose.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3.8'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  n8n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">n8nio/n8n:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">always</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    ports</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'5678:5678'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">N8N_HOST=automation.yourdomain.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">N8N_PORT=5678</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">N8N_PROTOCOL=https</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GENERIC_TIMEZONE=Asia/Shanghai</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DB_TYPE=postgresdb</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DB_POSTGRESDB_HOST=postgres</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DB_POSTGRESDB_PORT=5432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DB_POSTGRESDB_USER=n8n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DB_POSTGRESDB_PASSWORD=${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DB_POSTGRESDB_DATABASE=n8n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY=${ENCRYPTION_KEY}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXECUTIONS_DATA_SAVE_ON_SUCCESS=none</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXECUTIONS_DATA_SAVE_ON_ERROR=all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXECUTIONS_DATA_PRUNE=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXECUTIONS_DATA_MAX_AGE=168</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">n8n_data:/home/node/.n8n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    depends_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  postgres</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres:16</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">always</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">POSTGRES_USER=n8n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">POSTGRES_PASSWORD=${POSTGRES_PASSWORD}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">POSTGRES_DB=n8n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  n8n_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  postgres_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span></code></pre></div><p>环境变量文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# .env&#10;POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your_secure_password_here&#10;ENCRYPTION_KEY=your_32_char_encryption_key_here\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">POSTGRES_PASSWORD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">your_secure_password_here</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ENCRYPTION_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">your_32_char_encryption_key_here</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启动命令：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker compose up -d&#10;# 验证运行状态&#10;docker compose ps&#10;# 查看日志&#10;docker compose logs -f n8n\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 验证运行状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看日志</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> n8n</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ssl-配置-caddy-反向代理\">SSL 配置（Caddy 反向代理）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# Caddyfile&#10;automation.yourdomain.com {&#10;    reverse_proxy localhost:5678&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># Caddyfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>automation.yourdomain.com {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    reverse_proxy localhost:5678</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Caddy 会自动申请和续期 Let&#39;s Encrypt 证书。</p>\n<h3 id=\"队列模式-水平扩展\">队列模式（水平扩展）</h3><p>当工作流执行量增大时，启用队列模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 追加到 docker-compose.yml&#10;services:&#10;  n8n:&#10;    environment:&#10;      - EXECUTIONS_MODE=queue&#10;      - QUEUE_BULL_REDIS_HOST=redis&#10;      - QUEUE_HEALTH_CHECK_ACTIVE=true&#10;&#10;  n8n-worker:&#10;    image: n8nio/n8n:latest&#10;    command: worker&#10;    environment:&#10;      # 与主实例共享相同的数据库和 Redis 配置&#10;      - EXECUTIONS_MODE=queue&#10;      - QUEUE_BULL_REDIS_HOST=redis&#10;    depends_on:&#10;      - redis&#10;      - postgres&#10;&#10;  redis:&#10;    image: redis:7-alpine&#10;    restart: always&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - redis_data:/data\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 追加到 docker-compose.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  n8n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXECUTIONS_MODE=queue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">QUEUE_BULL_REDIS_HOST=redis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">QUEUE_HEALTH_CHECK_ACTIVE=true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  n8n-worker</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">n8nio/n8n:latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    command</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">worker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      # 与主实例共享相同的数据库和 Redis 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">EXECUTIONS_MODE=queue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">QUEUE_BULL_REDIS_HOST=redis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    depends_on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redis</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">postgres</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  redis</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shi